      <description>As per a report by Down to Earth, the Central Government has failed to pay the wages of the workers under the MGNREGA Scheme. As per the data given on that article the Government owes around Rs.2,800 crore to the workers for this financial year and around Rs.1,984 crore for the previous financial year.</description>
