    <item>
      <title>कोशकीय प्रक्रियाओं से जुड़ा अहम खुलासा - The News Beans</title>
      <link>https://thenewsbeans.com/%e0%a4%95%e0%a5%8b%e0%a4%b6%e0%a4%95%e0%a5%80%e0%a4%af-%e0%a4%aa%e0%a5%8d%e0%a4%b0%e0%a4%95%e0%a5%8d%e0%a4%b0%e0%a4%bf%e0%a4%af%e0%a4%be%e0%a4%93%e0%a4%82-%e0%a4%b8%e0%a5%87-%e0%a4%9c%e0%a5%81/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=%25e0%25a4%2595%25e0%25a5%258b%25e0%25a4%25b6%25e0%25a4%2595%25e0%25a5%2580%25e0%25a4%25af-%25e0%25a4%25aa%25e0%25a5%258d%25e0%25a4%25b0%25e0%25a4%2595%25e0%25a5%258d%25e0%25a4%25b0%25e0%25a4%25bf%25e0%25a4%25af%25e0%25a4%25be%25e0%25a4%2593%25e0%25a4%2582-%25e0%25a4%25b8%25e0%25a5%2587-%25e0%25a4%259c%25e0%25a5%2581</link>
      <description>पतली चादरों और झिल्लियों (Membranes) को त्रि-आयामी (3डी) आकार देना सामग्री-विज्ञान की एक ऐसी विशेषता है, जो बड़े पैमाने पर आकारिकी (Morphogenesis) से लेकर आणविक दवा वितरण तक, विविध जैविक प्क्रियाओं को रेखांकित करती है। विशिष्ट 3डी आकृतियों के बीच कोशिका झिल्ली की निर्बाध परिवर्तनशीलता; कोशिका विभाजन, कोशिका गतिशीलता, कोशिकाओं में पोषक तत्वों के परिवहन, और वायरल संक्रमण जैसी जैविक घटनाओं में महत्वपूर्ण भूमिका निभाती है।</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://thenewsbeans.com/%e0%a4%95%e0%a5%8b%e0%a4%b6%e0%a4%95%e0%a5%80%e0%a4%af-%e0%a4%aa%e0%a5%8d%e0%a4%b0%e0%a4%95%e0%a5%8d%e0%a4%b0%e0%a4%bf%e0%a4%af%e0%a4%be%e0%a4%93%e0%a4%82-%e0%a4%b8%e0%a5%87-%e0%a4%9c%e0%a5%81/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=%25e0%25a4%2595%25e0%25a5%258b%25e0%25a4%25b6%25e0%25a4%2595%25e0%25a5%2580%25e0%25a4%25af-%25e0%25a4%25aa%25e0%25a5%258d%25e0%25a4%25b0%25e0%25a4%2595%25e0%25a5%258d%25e0%25a4%25b0%25e0%25a4%25bf%25e0%25a4%25af%25e0%25a4%25be%25e0%25a4%2593%25e0%25a4%2582-%25e0%25a4%25b8%25e0%25a5%2587-%25e0%25a4%259c%25e0%25a5%2581</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://thenewsbeans.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Cell-Membrane-Defense-Against-COVID-19.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
      <pubDate>Fri, 30 Sep 2022 06:48:50 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
